                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            White</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-06-20"><hi rendition="#italic">June 20,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay states that Mr. White may attend the funeral of the late King of Saxony,
                    to be held at Dresden, representing the President of the United States.)</p>
            </div>
